{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>May my teaching drop as the rain.</b> Behold, my teaching shall indeed flow and come in a torrent like rain upon those who understand, who are prepared to receive the overflowing of the source of wisdom." "<b>May my saying distill as the dew.</b> And it gives also, according to what is revealed of it, some knowledge to ordinary people, which though small is very good like the dew, so that it is as עֲלֵי דֶשֶׂא upon tender grass, from which the discerning shall behold wonders." "<b>And as showers upon the grass.</b> So that even ordinary people may acquire through it some knowledge by which to know their Creator in some manner — if so, you Israel who have received it."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:53.778331055Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}